From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/a8xx: accept the A830 chip id 0x44050000

Let the A830 entry match the 0x44050000 id the SM8750 devicetree keeps.
adreno_is_a830() checks the entry's first id, so A830 handling is unchanged.

---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_catalog.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_catalog.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_catalog.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_catalog.c
@@ -2715,7 +2715,7 @@
 
 static const struct adreno_info a8xx_gpus[] = {
 	{
-		.chip_ids = ADRENO_CHIP_IDS(0x44050001),
+		.chip_ids = ADRENO_CHIP_IDS(0x44050001, 0x44050000),
 		.family = ADRENO_8XX_GEN1,
 		.fw = {
 			[ADRENO_FW_SQE] = "gen80000_sqe.fw",
